          "id": "code-ml-32-1-ch32_1_scratch",
          "title": "First-Principles NumPy: Analisis Dimensionality Drowning (68.1% Zero-Tab Split) & Oblique 256D OOF Probe",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "32_1_dimensionality_drowning_and_oblique_probe_scratch.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.special import expit\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(321)\n\n# 1. Audit Matematis Dimensionality Drowning: Split Budget & RAM Histogram GBDT\nd_tab = 15\nn_prod = 1_000_000\nprint(f\"=== 1. Analisis Dimensionality Drowning (d_tab={d_tab}, N={n_prod:,} baris) ===\")\nfor d_emb in [0, 64, 256, 768, 1536]:\n    total_d = d_tab + d_emb\n    tab_share = d_tab / total_d\n    m = max(1, int(np.floor(np.sqrt(total_d))))\n    p_zero_tab = float(np.prod([(d_emb - i) / (total_d - i) for i in range(m)])) if d_emb >= m else 0.0\n    ram_f32_gb = (n_prod * total_d * 4) / (1024 ** 3)\n    print(\n        f\"d_emb={d_emb:4d} | Total={total_d:4d} | Porsi Tab={tab_share:6.2%} \"\n        f\"| P(0 Tab di Split)={p_zero_tab:6.2%} | RAM Float32={ram_f32_gb:5.2f} GB\"\n    )\n\n# 2. First-Principles NumPy: Oblique Semantic Signal 256D vs Axis-Aligned Stump vs OOF Probe\nn, d_emb, r_eff = 1000, 256, 48\nZ_sem = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(n, r_eff))\nQ_rot, _ = np.linalg.qr(rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(d_emb, r_eff)))\nE_raw = Z_sem @ Q_rot.T + rng.normal(0.0, 0.10, size=(n, d_emb))\nE = E_raw / np.linalg.norm(E_raw, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n\nw_lat = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=r_eff)\nw_true = Q_rot @ (w_lat / np.linalg.norm(w_lat))\nlogits_true = 17.5 * (E @ w_true)\ny = rng.binomial(1, expit(logits_true))\n\ndef roc_auc_num(y_true: np.ndarray, scores: np.ndarray) -> float:\n    order = np.argsort(scores, kind=\"mergesort\")\n    y_s = y_true[order]\n    n_pos = int(np.sum(y_s == 1))\n    n_neg = len(y_s) - n_pos\n    ranks = np.arange(1, len(y_s) + 1, dtype=float)\n    return float((ranks[y_s == 1].sum() - n_pos * (n_pos + 1) / 2.0) / (n_pos * n_neg))\n\ndef fit_l2_logistic_newton(X_tr: np.ndarray, y_tr: np.ndarray, lam: float = 0.05, n_iter: int = 7) -> np.ndarray:\n    p = X_tr.shape[1]\n    w = np.zeros(p)\n    I = np.eye(p)\n    for _ in range(n_iter):\n        prob = expit(X_tr @ w)\n        g = X_tr.T @ (prob - y_tr) + lam * w\n        W = np.clip(prob * (1.0 - prob), 1e-6, None)\n        H = (X_tr.T * W) @ X_tr + lam * I\n        w -= np.linalg.solve(H, g)\n    return w\n\nsingle_aucs = [max(roc_auc_num(y, E[:, j]), 1.0 - roc_auc_num(y, E[:, j])) for j in range(d_emb)]\n\noof_logits = np.empty(n)\nfolds = np.array_split(np.arange(n), 5)\ncos_alignments = []\nfor k in range(5):\n    va = folds[k]\n    tr = np.concatenate([folds[j] for j in range(5) if j != k])\n    w_hat = fit_l2_logistic_newton(E[tr], y[tr], lam=0.05)\n    oof_logits[va] = E[va] @ w_hat\n    cos_alignments.append(float((w_hat @ w_true) / (np.linalg.norm(w_hat) * np.linalg.norm(w_true))))\n\nprint(f\"\\n=== 2. Ekstraksi Sinyal Semantik Oblique 256D -> 1D OOF Score (N={n}, L2-Normalized) ===\")\nprint(f\"Max |w_true_j| / ||w_true||        : {np.max(np.abs(w_true))/np.linalg.norm(w_true):.4f} (tersebar di 256 koordinat!)\")\nprint(f\"Best Single Axis-Aligned Coord AUC : {max(single_aucs):.4f} (median={np.median(single_aucs):.4f} -> nyaris acak!)\")\nprint(f\"5-Fold OOF L2 Linear Probe AUC     : {roc_auc_num(y, oof_logits):.4f} (Cosine ke w_true = {np.mean(cos_alignments):.4f})\")\nprint(f\"Oracle True Semantic Logit AUC     : {roc_auc_num(y, logits_true):.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Analisis Dimensionality Drowning (d_tab=15, N=1,000,000 baris) ===\nd_emb=   0 | Total=  15 | Porsi Tab=100.00% | P(0 Tab di Split)= 0.00% | RAM Float32= 0.06 GB\nd_emb=  64 | Total=  79 | Porsi Tab=18.99% | P(0 Tab di Split)=16.97% | RAM Float32= 0.29 GB\nd_emb= 256 | Total= 271 | Porsi Tab= 5.54% | P(0 Tab di Split)=39.14% | RAM Float32= 1.01 GB\nd_emb= 768 | Total= 783 | Porsi Tab= 1.92% | P(0 Tab di Split)=58.79% | RAM Float32= 2.92 GB\nd_emb=1536 | Total=1551 | Porsi Tab= 0.97% | P(0 Tab di Split)=68.13% | RAM Float32= 5.78 GB\n\n=== 2. Ekstraksi Sinyal Semantik Oblique 256D -> 1D OOF Score (N=1000, L2-Normalized) ===\nMax |w_true_j| / ||w_true||        : 0.1799 (tersebar di 256 koordinat!)\nBest Single Axis-Aligned Coord AUC : 0.6390 (median=0.5389 -> nyaris acak!)\n5-Fold OOF L2 Linear Probe AUC     : 0.8680 (Cosine ke w_true = 0.5328)\nOracle True Semantic Logit AUC     : 0.8950",
