          "task": "Implementasikan fungsi `hinton_kd_step_metrics(X, Y_oh, Z_teacher, W_init, T=4.0, alpha=0.85, lr=0.5)` dari nol menggunakan NumPy: hitung Hinton KD Loss $\\mathcal{L} = \\alpha T^2 D_{\\text{KL}}(\\mathbf{p}_T \\| \\mathbf{q}_T) + (1 - \\alpha)\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{CE}}(\\mathbf{Y}_{\\text{oh}}, \\mathbf{q}_1)$ dan gradien eksaknya terhadap matriks bobot `W_init` baik **dengan** pengali `T^2` (`g_t2`) maupun **tanpa** pengali `T^2` (`g_no`), lakukan tepat 1 langkah *gradient descent* `W_new = W_init - lr * g_t2`, lalu kembalikan tuple 4 angka dibulatkan 4 desimal `(loss_before, loss_after, norm_g_with_t2, norm_g_without_t2)`.",
          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef hinton_kd_step_metrics(X, Y_oh, Z_teacher, W_init, T: float = 4.0, alpha: float = 0.85, lr: float = 0.5) -> tuple[float, float, float, float]:\n    # TODO: hitung softmax(Z, T), loss KD + gradien dengan T^2 vs tanpa T^2, update 1 langkah GD\n    pass\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(3230)\nX = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(120, 16))\nW_t = rng.normal(0.0, 0.6, size=(16, 4))\nZ_t = X @ W_t\nY_oh = np.eye(4)[np.argmax(Z_t, axis=1)]\nW0 = np.zeros((16, 4))\nprint(hinton_kd_step_metrics(X, Y_oh, Z_t, W0, T=4.0, alpha=0.85, lr=0.5))",
