          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(324)\n\n# 1. Cold-Start Merchant Risk: Semantic k-NN Prior + Empirical-Bayes Optimal Blend (m0 = 45)\nn_hist, n_new, D = 600, 300, 64\nseg_hist = rng.integers(0, 6, size=n_hist)\nseg_new = rng.integers(0, 6, size=n_new)\nseg_centers = rng.normal(0.0, 1.0, size=(6, D))\nseg_risks = np.array([0.02, 0.05, 0.09, 0.16, 0.24, 0.35])\n\ndef l2_norm(M: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n    return M / np.maximum(np.linalg.norm(M, axis=1, keepdims=True), 1e-12)\n\nE_hist = l2_norm(seg_centers[seg_hist] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.45, size=(n_hist, D)))\nE_new = l2_norm(seg_centers[seg_new] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.45, size=(n_new, D)))\n\ntrue_risk_hist = np.clip(seg_risks[seg_hist] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.025, size=n_hist), 0.005, 0.60)\ntrue_risk_new = np.clip(seg_risks[seg_new] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.045, size=n_new), 0.005, 0.60)\nglobal_prior = float(true_risk_hist.mean())\n\nS_cos = E_new @ E_hist.T\nK_nn, tau_knn = 15, 12.0\ntop_idx = np.argsort(-S_cos, axis=1)[:, :K_nn]\ntop_sim = np.take_along_axis(S_cos, top_idx, axis=1)\nw_knn = np.exp(tau_knn * (top_sim - top_sim.max(axis=1, keepdims=True)))\nw_knn /= w_knn.sum(axis=1, keepdims=True)\npred_sem_prior = np.sum(w_knn * true_risk_hist[top_idx], axis=1)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Siklus Hidup Cold-Start Merchant (RMSE Risiko Chargeback di n=0 -> 100 Transaksi) ===\")\nm0 = 45.0\nfor n_obs in [0, 3, 10, 30, 100]:\n    if n_obs == 0:\n        emp_rate = np.full(n_new, global_prior)\n    else:\n        obs_cb = rng.binomial(n_obs, true_risk_new)\n        emp_rate = obs_cb / n_obs\n    gamma = n_obs / (n_obs + m0)\n    hybrid_pred = gamma * emp_rate + (1.0 - gamma) * pred_sem_prior\n    rmse_tab = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((emp_rate - true_risk_new) ** 2)))\n    rmse_sem = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((pred_sem_prior - true_risk_new) ** 2)))\n    rmse_hyb = float(np.sqrt(np.mean((hybrid_pred - true_risk_new) ** 2)))\n    print(\n        f\"n_txn={n_obs:3d} (gamma={gamma:4.2f}) | Tabular-Only RMSE={rmse_tab:.4f} \"\n        f\"| Semantic-Only RMSE={rmse_sem:.4f} | Hybrid EB-Blend RMSE={rmse_hyb:.4f}\"\n    )\n\n# 2. Confidence-Based Model Cascade: Optimal Bayes Escalation Threshold tau* = 1 - r2 - c2/c_err\nn_req = 4000\nis_hard = rng.random(n_req) < 0.16\np1_conf = np.where(\n    is_hard,\n    np.clip(rng.beta(3.0, 1.6, size=n_req), 0.50, 0.89),\n    np.clip(rng.beta(18.0, 0.7, size=n_req), 0.82, 0.996),\n)\nt1_correct = rng.binomial(1, p1_conf)\nr2_err = 0.020\nt2_correct = rng.binomial(1, 1.0 - r2_err, size=n_req)\n\nc1, c2, c_err = 0.000002, 0.0020, 0.025\ntau_star_theory = 1.0 - r2_err - (c2 / c_err)  # = 0.900\n\nprint(f\"\\n=== 2. Pareto Frontier Model Cascade (N={n_req:,}, Teori Bayes Optimal tau* = {tau_star_theory:.3f}) ===\")\nfor tau in [0.00, 0.70, 0.82, tau_star_theory, 0.96, 1.01]:\n    esc = p1_conf < tau\n    sys_ok = np.where(esc, t2_correct, t1_correct)\n    esc_pct = float(np.mean(esc))\n    acc = float(np.mean(sys_ok))\n    avg_lat = float(np.mean(np.where(esc, 602.0, 2.0)))\n    cloud_per_1m = float(np.mean(c1 + esc * c2) * 1e6)\n    total_per_1m = float(np.mean(c1 + esc * c2 + (1 - sys_ok) * c_err) * 1e6)\n    tag = \" <-- OPTIMAL!\" if abs(tau - tau_star_theory) < 1e-6 else \"\"\n    print(\n        f\"tau={tau:5.3f} | Esc={esc_pct:5.1%} | Acc={acc:6.2%} | Lat={avg_lat:5.1f}ms \"\n        f\"| Cloud=${cloud_per_1m:6.0f}/1M | TotalCost=${total_per_1m:6.0f}/1M{tag}\"\n    )",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Siklus Hidup Cold-Start Merchant (RMSE Risiko Chargeback di n=0 -> 100 Transaksi) ===\nn_txn=  0 (gamma=0.00) | Tabular-Only RMSE=0.1140 | Semantic-Only RMSE=0.0430 | Hybrid EB-Blend RMSE=0.0430\nn_txn=  3 (gamma=0.06) | Tabular-Only RMSE=0.2134 | Semantic-Only RMSE=0.0430 | Hybrid EB-Blend RMSE=0.0424\nn_txn= 10 (gamma=0.18) | Tabular-Only RMSE=0.1123 | Semantic-Only RMSE=0.0430 | Hybrid EB-Blend RMSE=0.0411\nn_txn= 30 (gamma=0.40) | Tabular-Only RMSE=0.0656 | Semantic-Only RMSE=0.0430 | Hybrid EB-Blend RMSE=0.0372\nn_txn=100 (gamma=0.69) | Tabular-Only RMSE=0.0324 | Semantic-Only RMSE=0.0430 | Hybrid EB-Blend RMSE=0.0264\n\n=== 2. Pareto Frontier Model Cascade (N=4,000, Teori Bayes Optimal tau* = 0.900) ===\ntau=0.000 | Esc= 0.0% | Acc=92.07% | Lat=  2.0ms | Cloud=$     2/1M | TotalCost=$  1983/1M\ntau=0.700 | Esc= 8.3% | Acc=95.40% | Lat= 52.0ms | Cloud=$   168/1M | TotalCost=$  1318/1M\ntau=0.820 | Esc=11.6% | Acc=95.97% | Lat= 71.5ms | Cloud=$   233/1M | TotalCost=$  1240/1M\ntau=0.900 | Esc=22.4% | Acc=97.42% | Lat=136.7ms | Cloud=$   451/1M | TotalCost=$  1095/1M <-- OPTIMAL!\ntau=0.960 | Esc=43.0% | Acc=98.35% | Lat=259.7ms | Cloud=$   861/1M | TotalCost=$  1274/1M\ntau=1.010 | Esc=100.0% | Acc=98.35% | Lat=602.0ms | Cloud=$  2002/1M | TotalCost=$  2414/1M",
