          "actualOutput": "=== Hybrid Cascade Routing (N_test=850: 760 ID + 90 OOD, tau_ood=0.372) ===\n1. Tier-1 Classical Gate Only (0%)     | Esc= 0.0% | ID=98.82% | OOD=35.56% | All=92.12% | Cloud=$    2/1M | Total=$ 3549/1M\n2. Tier-2 Foundation Only (100% LLM)   | Esc=100.0% | ID=96.58% | OOD=88.89% | All=95.76% | Cloud=$ 2002/1M | Total=$ 3908/1M\n3. Margin Cascade Only (m < 0.45)      | Esc= 5.6% | ID=99.74% | OOD=53.33% | All=94.82% | Cloud=$  115/1M | Total=$ 2444/1M\n4. Margin + OOD Guardrail Cascade      | Esc=17.3% | ID=99.74% | OOD=88.89% | All=98.59% | Cloud=$  348/1M | Total=$  983/1M",
